WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:02.600
To find a shorter side, subtract.

2
00:00:03.278 --> 00:00:06.453
We want the long side to be ten. Which short side?

3
00:00:07.281 --> 00:00:11.681
The big square must be one hundred. Take away thirty-six: sixty-four.

4
00:00:16.879 --> 00:00:19.304
So the side is the square root: eight.
